License note

This repository contains an academic web application and documentation associated with the thesis work by Iván Alejandro Guajardo Arias at Universidad de Santiago de Chile.

The thesis document indicates a Creative Commons Attribution-Chile 3.0 licence for the written work. The software licence should be confirmed by the authors before declaring the source code as MIT, GPL, Apache or another open-source licence.

Until a formal software licence is selected, treat the source code as distributed for academic review and institutional publication with attribution to the authors.
